# Cross-repo siblings cloned by setup-dev-env (clone-siblings) at the
# workspace-lock-pinned revisions (see
# codetracer-specs/Testing/Cross-Repo-CI-Integration.md).
#
# The dev shell's shellHook (flake.nix) symlinks each sibling into
# dist/<name>, which compiler/nim.cfg puts on the Nim search path so
# `./koch boot` can link the CTFS trace-format writer (CTFS-M1 made
# libzstd + the trace-format library a link-time requirement for bin/nim
# itself). nim-stew must carry the slim-system `import std/assertions`
# guard, which the metacraft-labs fork's pinned revision provides.
#
# NOTE: nim-results is NOT listed here. It lives under
# github.com/arnetheduck (not metacraft-labs), and clone-siblings
# resolves every sibling under the metacraft-labs org. The workflows
# clone it with an explicit step at its manifest-pinned revision.
codetracer-trace-format-nim
nim-stew
